     3,
     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\">Unsubscribe me too, I am also not a GSOC mentor.</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, Jul 10, 2026, 00:42 Juhi Chitkara &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">juhi...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\">unsubscribe, I am not a GSOC mentor</div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, Jul 9, 2026 at 8:09 AM Killick, Rebecca &lt;<a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>r.ki...@lancaster.ac.uk</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi GSOC mentors,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nAt the time of writing, 10/23 project mentors with mid-term evaluations due this week still haven&#39;t submitted them.  A reminder that the deadline is tomorrow (10th July) at 18:00 UTC.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIf you are in the US time zones, then please try to submit your evaluations today as you don&#39;t want to get caught out tomorrow - and give us gray hair in the process!</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI will chase individuals later today.  If evaluations are not submitted on-time then, along with delays to payment for contributors, there are consequences for the R-project&#39;s potential future participation in GSOC.  We really appreciate your on-time submissions.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Rebecca</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Pronouns: They/Them/Theirs</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont;font-size:9pt;color:black\"><b style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont\"><i style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont\">Please note:  Whilst I may choose to correspond by email during evenings and weekends as it fits best with my preferred working pattern, I do not expect responses\r\n outside your usual working pattern.</i></b></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont;font-size:9pt;color:black\"><b style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont\"><i style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont\"><br>\r\n</i></b></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f2d...@lancaster.ac.uk?anonymous&amp;ep=bwmEmailSignature\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f2d...@lancaster.ac.uk?anonymous%26ep%3DbwmEmailSignature&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351141007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nz54WTH1WNZ1uWKxWv6Sj\"><img size=\"528\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/gsoc-r/attach/10a6f5159f4a0/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" style=\"max-width:100%\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,120,212)\"><a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f2d...@lancaster.ac.uk?anonymous&amp;ep=bwmEmailSignature\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,120,212)\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://outlook.office.com/bookwithme/user/f2d...@lancaster.ac.uk?anonymous%26ep%3DbwmEmailSignature&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351141007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nz54WTH1WNZ1uWKxWv6Sj\">Book\r\n time to meet with me</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><table><tbody><tr><td>\r\n</td>\r\n<td></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;gsoc-r&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" data-email-masked>gsoc-r+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view 